<article>
	<h1><span>Private Messages: Write Private Message</span></h1>

	<ul class="nav">
		<li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li>
		<li><a href="#fields">Fields</a></li>
		<li><a href="#toolbar">Toolbar</a></li>
	</ul>

	<section id="overview">
		<h2><span>Overview</span></h2>

		<p>This is where you write a private message to another member.
			It is opened with the <strong>New</strong> button in the Messages list, or with the
			<strong>Reply</strong> button when viewing a message.</p>
	</section>
	<section id="fields">
		<h2><span>Fields</span></h2>

		<dl>
			<dt>Recipient</dt>
			<dd>The member to send the message to. Required.</dd>

			<dt>Subject</dt>
			<dd>The subject of the message, up to 250 characters. Required.</dd>

			<dt>Message</dt>
			<dd>The text of the message. It cannot be left empty.</dd>
		</dl>
	</section>
	<section id="toolbar">
		<h2><span>Toolbar</span></h2>
		<p>At the top right you will see the toolbar.</p>
		<p>The functions are:</p>
		<dl>
			<dt>Send</dt>
			<dd>Sends the message and returns to the Messages list.
				By default, the recipient is also sent an email saying a new private message has arrived.</dd>

			<dt>Cancel</dt>
			<dd>Returns to the Messages list without sending the message.</dd>

			<dt>Help</dt>
			<dd>Opens this help screen.</dd>
		</dl>
	</section>
</article>
